  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Blood Guillotine Gu advances into the highly acclaimed rank six demonic Gu Blood Deity, which ranks seventh among the Top Ten Great Demonic Gu in the world.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_guillotine_gu",
          "sys_top_ten_great_demonic_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In his previous life, when Fang Yuan created the Blood Wing demonic sect, he first wanted to refine Blood Deity instead of Spring Autumn Cicada, then reduced his expectations and refined Spring Autumn Cicada instead.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-wing-preference",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Immortal Crane Sect elders list Blood Sea’s nine true inheritances and end the list with rank six Immortal Gu blood deity.",
        "chapters": [
          407
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-sea-true-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
          "loc_blood_sea",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While guiding Fang Zheng, Fang Yuan plans that once Fang Zheng relies on him subconsciously, that will be the best time to refine Blood Deity.",
        "chapters": [
          1065
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-zheng-plan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s blood deity Immortal Gu recipe is still only seventy percent complete; he can no longer use the light of wisdom, but judges his grandmaster blood path and wisdom path attainment enough to deduce the rest at a far greater cost in time and effort.",
        "chapters": [
          1066
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "long-term-goal",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He has since completed the recipe with help from the light of wisdom, and his quasi-supreme refinement path attainment lets him turn it into the immortal killer move blood deity.",
        "chapters": [
          1564
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "long-term-goal",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Blood Sea Ancestor’s nine true inheritances of Gu Immortal level include blood deity Gu. Central Continent’s blood deity Immortal Gu true inheritance was fought over by the ten great ancient sects; they destroyed over half of it, and the incomplete Blood Deity Immortal Gu recipe ended up with Myriad Dragon Dock. After reviving, Giant Sun Immortal Venerable has blood path Immortal Gu refined and obtains blood battle Immortal Gu among them; of the other Immortal Gu among the nine true inheritances, all except Blood Deity have been tested and confirmed to already exist in the world.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "central-continent-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_blood_sea_ancestor",
          "reg_central_continent",
          "fac_myriad_dragon_dock",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
